    {
     "title": "A Place for Grace: All of a Sudden’s Ryusuke Hamaguchi on caregiving under capitalism and the radical art of paying attention",
     "link": "https://letterboxd.com/journal/ryusuke-hamaguchi-all-of-a-sudden-interview/",
     "time": "2026-11-25T03:54:42+13:00",
     "img": "https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/sm/upload/pg/ru/z4/eg/sudden1-0-960-0-540-crop-fill.jpg?k=881e6aa8ac",
     "intro": "With his luminous All of a Sudden opening in theaters, Ryusuke Hamaguchi reflects with Isaac Feldberg on the political power of open-hearted dialogue and the intense, tender chemistry between his lead actresses.",
     "category": "Interview"
